n countermeasure. Read the manual carefully, identify each anomaly, and respond accordingly. Of course, there may be new phenomena that have no established method of handling. In such cases, it is up to you, Supervisor, to make the call. <i>Please discover effective solutions for the sake of those who come after you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921090/extras/53544ce3f3ac87977454db18e2e6a030.avif?t=1761719528\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921090/extras_big/53544ce3f3ac87977454db18e2e6a030.webp?t=1761719528 width=1560 height=388 /></span><strong>\u25b6 What Awaits Behind the Door</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Due to the success of SARRAS Corp's research</span>, disappearance cases have increased in the area, and missing person posters are often found on doors. <i>(Of course, these have nothing to do with the company\u2019s research.)</i> To prevent conspiracy theories and baseless rumors, you have been dispatched as a Field Maintenance Supervisor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to remove all missing person posters delivered through one of the three doors by the security team. Naturally, anomalies may also emerge from those doors. To aid in your survival, we have provided useful items designed to help you respond effectively. Use them well, and complete your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921090/extras/a6fcd0f786f04297f4cc0fb5a1b2cf7e.avif?t=1761719528\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921090/extras_big/a6fcd0f786f04297f4cc0fb5a1b2cf7e.webp?t=1761719528 width=1560 height=388 /></span><strong>\u25b6 Your Guide to Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before starting your full duties, you\u2019ll be assisted by Mel, your dedicated guide. Through daily conversations, Mel will help you adapt to your role and gradually reveal the truth about SARRAS Corp and the facility. Survive to the end \u2014 and witness how it all concludes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you have a safe workday.</p>","developers":["LIBERUM PROJECT"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921090/3d8f31d94b7e7eac965953a62fa97147079d3741/header.jpg?t=1761719528","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3921090/668571440/8910f005291396c07ef316650f8deaa45aa24ebf/1760447255/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760518547","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3921090/668571440/8910f005291396c07ef316650f8deaa45aa24ebf/1760447255/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760518547","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3921090/668571440/8910f005291396c07ef316650f8deaa45aa24ebf/1760447255/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760518547","id":257176932,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176932/movie480.mp4?t=1760518547","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176932/movie_max.mp4?t=1760518547"},"name":"The ENDLESS BACKGATE - Steam Next Fest Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257176932/1275b88a2a7753dcac827b35b3971c71929057c7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760518547","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176932/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1760518547","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176932/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1760518547"}}],